  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **February 2022 (Wednesday)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Old Skin**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **Living Proof**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **Born In Time**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Thinking Of A Place**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **In Chains**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **twod2022-02-02.vwmule** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 134 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Audio quality surpasses the live album released by the band one year prior [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Attendees were required to present proof of their vaccination status [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **twod2022-02-02.vwmule**: taped by Alex Leary; transferred by Alex Leary; source: Microtech Gefell M21 > nBob actives > Sound Devices MixPre-6 (24/48) [1]",
